{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 39, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e4b-it", "content": "Hark a journey to the land of the rising sun a most wondrous quest I shall now weave for thee.\n\n**Day the First Arrival in Tokyo**\n\nFrom distant shores thou shalt arrive in Tokyo's grand embrace.\nNarita's gates shall yield thee to a bustling place.\nA swift train ride to Shinjuku's heights a modern marvel to behold.\nThen lodging found a haven safe from winter's cold.\nExplore the streets a vibrant sight of neon bright.\nDine on ramen savory a culinary delight.\n\n**Day the Second Tokyo's Wonders**\n\nTo Asakusa then we venture a temple old and wise.\nSenso-ji's gates a prayer before thine eyes.\nThe Imperial Palace a glimpse of regal grace.\nThen Ginza's shops where fortunes interlace.\nUeno Park a respite green and calm.\nMuseums abound a cultural balm.\n\n**Day the Third Hakone's Beauty**\n\nHakone's hills await a scenic ride.\nMount Fuji's peak a glorious pride.\nCruise across Lake Ashi waters serene and blue.\nVolcanic hot springs a soothing view.\nArt museums grace the landscape fair.\nNature's beauty beyond compare.\n\n**Day the Fourth Kyoto's Ancient Heart**\n\nA bullet train doth whisk thee hence to Kyoto's keep.\nA city steeped in history secrets deep.\nFushimi Inari's gates a vermillion dream.\nThousands of torii a vibrant gleam.\nGion district wander where geishas tread.\nA glimpse of old Japan a vision spread.\n\n**Day the Fifth Kyoto's Temples**\n\nKinkaku-ji's gold a shimmering grace.\nThe Golden Pavilion a sacred space.\nRyoan-ji's garden stones a tranquil art.\nMeditation's peace a healing start.\nArashiyama Bamboo Grove a whispering sound.\nNature's cathedral hallowed ground.\n\n**Day the Sixth Nara's Deer**\n\nTo Nara we journey a city old and grand.\nFriendly deer roam free throughout the land.\nTodai-ji Temple houses Buddha's might.\nA colossal statue a wondrous sight.\nKasuga Taisha Shrine lanterns glow.\nAncient traditions softly flow.\n\n**Day the Seventh Osaka's Delights**\n\nOsaka's vibrant energy doth call.\nDotonbori's lights enthrall all.\nOsaka Castle stands a mighty keep.\nCulinary treasures secrets deep.\nTakoyaki and okonomiyaki a taste divine.\nA foodie's paradise truly fine.\n\n**Day the Eighth Farewell**\n\nWith heavy heart thou must depart.\nFrom Japan's shores a work of art.\nMemories made a treasure to hold.\nOf sights and sounds both new and old.\nUntil we meet again fair traveler true.\nFarewell Japan adieu adieu.\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -0.012519695796072483}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -7.152555099310121e-07}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.5660643577575684}, {"token": "▁journey", "logprob": -0.9999403357505798}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.0010852882405743003}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -0.06870529800653458}, {"token": "▁land", "logprob": -1.6506953239440918}, {"token": "▁of", "logprob": -1.1920928244535389e-07}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -0.3405719995498657}, {"token": "▁rising", "logprob": -0.09441725164651871}, {"token": "▁sun", "logprob": -0.0002165798214264214}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.10412652045488358}, {"token": "▁most", "logprob": -0.11310440301895142}, {"token": "▁wondrous", "logprob": -0.0393388457596302}, {"token": "▁quest", "logprob": -0.34379351139068604}, {"token": "▁I", "logprob": -0.33864840865135193}, {"token": "▁shall", "logprob": -0.008671367540955544}, {"token": "▁now", "logprob": -0.38142129778862}, {"token": "▁weave", "logprob": -0.3719952702522278}, {"token": "▁for", "logprob": -0.004029845353215933}, {"token": "▁thee", "logprob": -0.0019584777764976025}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.11597185581922531}, {"token": "\n\n", "logprob": -0.00195229088421911}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -8.4638240878121e-06}, {"token": "Day", "logprob": -0.0036690791603177786}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -1.3142515420913696}, {"token": "▁First", "logprob": -1.1801649634435307e-05}, {"token": "▁Arrival", "logprob": -0.75073248147964